        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sooni Taraporevala, Mira Nair, Denzel Washington, Sarita Choudhury, Roshan Seth\n- Works: Mississippi Masala, The Namesake, Salaam Bombay, Little Zizou\n- Roles: screenwriter, photographer, filmmaker, director\n\nFacts:\n- Sooni Taraporevala was born in 1957 and is an Indian screenwriter, photographer, and filmmaker.\n- Sooni Taraporevala is best known as the screenwriter of Salaam Bombay (1988), Mississippi Masala, and The Namesake, all of which were directed by Mira Nair.\n- Mississippi Masala is a 1991 romantic drama film directed by Mira Nair and based on a screenplay by Sooni Taraporevala.\n- Mississippi Masala stars Denzel Washington, Sarita Choudhury, and Roshan Seth.\n- Little Zizou is a 2008 Indian film in Hindi, Gujarati, and English that was written and directed by Sooni Taraporevala.",
